msgstr ""
"Vaše otkazivanje je završeno, a povrat novca je na putu. Može potrajati "
"nekoliko dana dok ne stigne na Vaš račun."

#: notifications/kinds.py:295
msgid "Cancellation under review"
msgstr "Otkazivanje se pregledava"

#: notifications/kinds.py:296
msgid ""
"Our team is reviewing your cancellation request. We'll let you know the "
"outcome."
msgstr "Naš tim pregledava vaš zahtjev za otkazivanje. Javit ćemo vam ishod."

#: notifications/kinds.py:305
msgid "Booking cancelled, no one's fault"
msgstr "Rezervacija otkazana bez ničije krivnje"

#: notifications/kinds.py:307
msgid ""
"The no-fault cancellation stands. The booking is cancelled and the poster "
