#: staff/templates/admin/bookings/booking/evidence.html:143
msgid ""
"Lean towards the family; ask for light evidence if needed. Upholding refunds "
"everything. Rejecting a helper's reason makes it a helper cancel (full "
"refund, the EUR 5 credit if it was under 24 h, a reliability fault); "
"rejecting a poster's reason applies the ordinary policy as of when they "
"asked."
msgstr ""
"Prednost dajte obitelji; po potrebi zatražite jednostavan dokaz. Prihvaćanje "
"vraća sve. Odbijanje razloga pomagača znači otkaz pomagača (puni povrat, "
"kredit od 5 EUR ako je bilo manje od 24 h, bod za pouzdanost); odbijanje "
"razloga naručitelja primjenjuje uobičajena pravila u trenutku zahtjeva."

#: staff/templates/admin/bookings/booking/evidence.html:147
#: staff/templates/admin/bookings/booking/evidence.html:166
msgid "Save decision"
msgstr "Spremi odluku"

#: staff/templates/admin/bookings/booking/evidence.html:156
msgid "No-show not settled"
msgstr "Nedolazak nije namiren"

#: staff/templates/admin/bookings/booking/evidence.html:157
msgid ""
"The poster said the helper didn't come and the helper didn't answer within "
"24 hours, but settling it failed. It is retried automatically; you can also "
"decide it here. Upholding settles it now (full refund, the EUR 5 credit if "
"it was under 24 h, a no-show fault that only queues a human review). It "
"can't be rejected: the helper didn't contest it."
msgstr ""
"Naručitelj je javio da pomagač nije došao, a pomagač nije odgovorio u roku "
"od 24 sata, ali namirenje nije uspjelo. Automatski se ponavlja; možete i "
"odlučiti ovdje. Potvrda to namiruje odmah (puni povrat, kredit od 5 EUR ako "
"je bilo manje od 24 h, oznaka nedolaska koja samo otvara ljudsku provjeru). "
"Ne može se odbiti: pomagač to nije osporio."

#: staff/templates/admin/bookings/booking/evidence.html:159
msgid "Contested no-show"
msgstr "Osporeni nedolazak"

#: staff/templates/admin/bookings/booking/evidence.html:160
msgid ""
"The poster said the helper didn't come and the helper answered that they "
"were there. Check the On my way, Running late and I've arrived taps and the "
"reminders in the booking events, and the chat. Upholding cancels the booking "
"as the helper's (full refund, the EUR 5 credit if it was under 24 h, a no-"
"show fault that only queues a human review). Rejecting keeps the booking: "
"the helper was there."
msgstr ""
"Naručitelj je javio da pomagač nije došao, a pomagač odgovara da je bio "
"tamo. Provjerite dodire Na putu sam, Kasnim i Stigao/la sam te podsjetnike u "
"događajima rezervacije i chat. Potvrda otkazuje rezervaciju kao pomagačevu "
"(puni povrat, kredit od 5 EUR ako je bilo manje od 24 h, oznaka nedolaska "
"koja samo otvara ljudsku provjeru). Odbijanje zadržava rezervaciju: pomagač "
"je bio tamo."

